# SFA (Semantic Flow Architecture)

Structure-centric, AI-as-executor programming paradigm. Engineers design the
data-flow graph; AI fills in module implementations under strict contracts.

## Install (development)

```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Quick start

```bash
sfa init            # create .sfa/ metadata dir + sfa.yml config
sfa extract         # parse source_dir with tree-sitter -> .sfa/elements.json
```

Full command reference and tutorial arrive with milestone M6.
